WeirdIKE vendored from Miguel0888/WeirdIKE @ 337a25d078685c8cbdb7d3eb6575421ed09c45ce
(GPL-2.0-or-later; independent RFC 7296 implementation -- see PROVENANCE.md / NOTICE).

Layout: FLAT (all headers + sources in this one directory) so a single include path
(-Isrc/weirdike) resolves every bare #include. Contents = WeirdIKE include/ + src/core/ +
src/esp/ + src/crypto/crypto_mbedtls.{c,h}. NOT included: host-only transports/tests/probes;
the ESP32 UDP transport bound to the egress source IP lives in ../../ipsec_runtime.cpp.

Build: add this dir to the include path and compile every *.c here (Arduino IDE compiles
src/ recursively; the PlatformIO src/CMakeLists.txt globs weirdike/*.c). Requires mbedTLS
MD/HMAC (SHA-1/SHA-256/SHA-384/SHA-512), AES-CBC/GCM, BIGNUM/MPI, CTR_DRBG and ENTROPY.
DH14 is implemented with mbedtls_mpi; MBEDTLS_DHM_C is NOT required (RFC3526 P/G data macros
are used from mbedtls/dhm.h).

